This cannot be undone.␀␀␀␀Wipe␀␀␀␀Turn radio2 off on the repeater?␀␀␀␀Change radio2 on the repeater? It answers first, then switches. If you reach it over radio2 you may lose contact.␀␀␀Apply␀␀␀Stop the update and put both radios back to normal?␀Install now? The repeater flashes the new firmware and reboots. Keep it powered.␀␀␀␀Start the update? The repeater and this radio move to the temporary radio and are off the normal mesh until it ends.␀␀␀␀Join this team?␀Joining adds the channels, turns team mode on, and sets radio2 to the team's MediaMesh.␀Joining adds the channels and turns team mode on.␀␀␀%s

